ルになってみせるもん！　\nだからねっ、殿も応援してくれたら嬉しいなぁ♪","welcome":"こーんにーちはーっ♪　蛤大好き～っ、\n新人アイドルの伊勢長島城だよぉ！　\nごぼーちゃんたちと一緒に、\nいっぱいいっぱい布教活動がんばりまーす♪","raw":{"CardID":403,"ClassID":10500,"DedicatedWeaponID":7008,"Rarity":4,"Tokusei1":30,"VoiceID":401,"AreaType":7,"GainableYakumodama":10,"DotScale":1.0,"HealthCorrection":109,"AttackCorrection":112,"DefenseCorrection":108,"RegenerationCorrection":100,"GrowUpID":5,"GrowUpLimitType":999,"AbilityID":9403,"GimmickID":403,"CutInYCorrection":-200,"MaxRenovationCount":2,"RenovationType":2,"Renovation1GimmickID":9403,"Renovation2AbilityID":11403,"Renovation2GimmickID":11403}}